BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.6 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 13.2 TL (Expected on a system where unsigned short is 16 bits: 330 units and 256 units. Unsigned arithmetic wraps modulo) Tj T* -0.081559 Tw (65536. Thus 120 ) Tj /F4 9.2 Tf 13.2 TL (-) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf 13.2 TL ( 65400 modulo 65536 equals 256. The result is not negative because unsigned arithmetic is defined) Tj T* 0 Tw (modulo one more than the maximum representable value. In production, validate that a rollover is plausible; otherwise) Tj T* (a bad reading could look like a large consumption.) Tj T* ET
